      <title>开发1小时，部署5小时：PM想做OPC，应用上线经验分享</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%911%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B25%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6PM%E6%83%B3%E5%81%9AOPC%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%BF%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB/</link>
